    %% CRD Dependencies (External Operators)
    ODHObs -->|"MonitoringStack<br/>ThanosQuerier<br/>ServiceMonitor<br/>PrometheusRule"| COO["Cluster Observability<br/>Operator"]
    ODHObs -->|"TempoMonolithic<br/>TempoStack"| TempoOp["Tempo Operator"]
